          <p data-lang-en="The Site may contain links to third-party websites (such as Sirha, Bocuse d'Or, and the International Catering Cup). We do not control and are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or terms of these external sites." data-lang-fr="Le Site peut contenir des liens vers des sites web tiers (tels que Sirha, le Bocuse d'Or et l'International Catering Cup). Nous ne contrôlons pas et ne sommes pas responsables du contenu, des pratiques de confidentialité ou des conditions de ces sites externes.">The Site may contain links to third-party websites (such as Sirha, Bocuse d'Or, and the International Catering Cup). We do not control and are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or terms of these external sites.</p>
